// # Ooda CLI QA Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the cli self-test probe drivers.
//
// Setup: Each probe exercises one argv dispatch path. If a probe fails, the cli/ package fails to release.
//
// Beats:
//   1. probe_argv.oo — verify main.oo dispatches all 12+ in-process subcommands to the right function.
//   2. probe_spawn.oo — verify the 3 spawn entries (opm, lsp, mcp) resolve via $OODACODEX/bin/<name> or $PATH.
//   3. probe_api_surface.oo — verify the 4 subdirs (build, fix, fmt, token) match the api_surface=4 declaration.
//
// (Note: these are stub probes for the reorg. Real test logic lands in a later phase.)

import "probe_argv.oo";
import "probe_spawn.oo";
import "probe_api_surface.oo";
